[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10932.55, "timestamp": "03:02:12", "text": "但这就像翻译一样。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10936.469, "timestamp": "03:02:16", "text": "比如日本人，还有罗姆人，然后是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10940.23, "timestamp": "03:02:20", "text": "英文翻译。这正常吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10943.59, "timestamp": "03:02:23", "text": "必须陡峭，而且想让你下车"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10946.389, "timestamp": "03:02:26", "text": "它的背面。是的，可能就是那个原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10949.51, "timestamp": "03:02:29", "text": "案件。我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10951.269, "timestamp": "03:02:31", "text": "总之，我们跟他们谈谈吧。让我们来看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10973.99, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10976.63, "timestamp": "03:02:56", "text": "嗯？你为什么？"}]